    11	//! ROOT CAUSE (diagnosed by the isolation matrix below, `isolate_settled_stirring_mechanisms`,
    12	//! water-only tank, settled-tail mean KE):
    13	//!   baseline (pure APIC)  ~67   |  pure PIC (no affine)  ~1.3   |  relief OFF  ~7.6   |  32 sweeps  ~17
    14	//! Mechanism: the local-Jacobi pressure solve is intentionally UNDER-converged (real-time design),
    15	//! leaving a standing density error; the density relief converts that error into a velocity each
    16	//! frame; the lossless APIC affine field accumulates it (no numerical dissipation); the pool
    17	//! sloshes and re-creates the error — a self-sustaining limit cycle. Pure PIC (C zeroed) collapses
    18	//! it (the C is the lossless CARRIER); relief OFF collapses it (relief is the SOURCE); more sweeps
