   117	// is bitwise-identical — the free-water regression gate pins this). cell_classify's density
   118	// census normalizes by the corner φ_f for the same reason: a saturated pore cell at
   119	// ρ̄ = φ_f·ρ_rest is FULL, not a surface cell, and must get neither relief nor suction.
